[Music]  spider-man no way home stunt coordinator  george cuttle's post caused great buzz  among the fan community recently  after the filming was completed cuddle  thanked a large number of people from  the team including tom holland and  zendaya  so far nothing out of the ordinary  notable was however the mention of stunt  performer chris daniels  who already assisted dobie maguire in  samrami's spider-man trilogy  in connection with the fact that andrew  garfield stuntman william spencer  recently published pictures of his  collaboration with tomorrow and stuntman  craig tonley  it seems very likely that the three  spider-man will be appearing in the same  film  additionally last monday it came to  light that roger pereira the spanish  voice actor of tobey maguire is  already working on spider-man in the way  home can't have a lot of hints about the  trio  but officially marvel and sony are still  staying out of fan speculations  spider-man no way home will be released  on december 17  2021 the upcoming video game adaption  borderlands has already been filmed  yet lionsgate didn't miss the  opportunity to announce a new addition  to the cast  we're talking about the venezuelan actor  edgar ramirez who will play the  businessman  and weapons producer atlas gearbox boss  randy pitchfork shared more than just  that with fans via twitter as the 49  year old also had some information on  the universe in which the film will take  place  there will be clear separation between  the borderlands movie universe and the  borland's video game universe the  characters and the style of the film  will be similar but at the same time  they will focus on new storylines and  new tales that have not been told before  meaning that the game of the movie will  offer two completely different contents  in addition to the recently cast ramirez  the movie's cast also include kate  blanchet as lilith kevin hart as roland  jamie lee curtis as tanis jack black as  claptrap florian monteneux creek ariana  greenblatt as tiny tina  and haley bennett in a still undisclosed  role as synopsis has also been  officially revealed so for example lift  will have to face her past and return to  her home planet pandora  there she will form an alliance with  various companions to find the missing  daughter of the mighty atlas  they will all have to fight against  alien creatures and ruthless  bandits as the girl could be the key to  unimaginable power  unfortunately a release date for the  borderlands film has not yet been  specified  the story of creed around sylvester  stallone is rocky balboa and michael b  jordan as adonis johnson in 2015 not  only thrilled boxing fans around the  globe in both films released so far  rocky actor stallone played a major role  as the protagonist trainer and mentor  but apparently that's going to change in  the upcoming third part  as stallone confirmed in an instagram  post he will no longer be  involved in creed iii therefore michael  b jordan's role of adonis johnson will  seemingly get more emphasis in the  storyline of the film as confirmed by  stallone  those who still want to see more of  rocky balboa can look forward to an  upcoming prequel series to the rocky  saga however the 74 year old stallone  will not be playing the lead role  as the planned protagonist of the series  is only 17 years old  we are eagerly awaiting the upcoming  creed 3 which will also be michael b  jordan's directing debut the release  date is expected to be in november  2022 after  several shooting breaks and unfortunate  injuries to lead actor henry cavill the  witcher team was happy to announce the  completion of shooting to fans  in a video showrunner lauren s his ridge  expresses her gratitude to the more than  1200 people  involved in the production and recaps  the 158 long days of filming for season  2.  a total of 89 actors worked in front of  the camera and paid meticulous  attention to hygienic measures behind  the camera fans will however be most  pleased with another piece of news since  the witcher season 2 will be released  this year there is no precise date yet  but we strongly expect to be released at  the end of the year  what do you anticipate from the second  season and do you think the team will  manage to tie in with a great first  season  feel free to write us in the comments  some time ago paramount pictures put its  blockbuster  the tomorrow war up for sale to the big  streaming providers as deadline reported  several were interested in the action  spectacle with chris pratt in the lead  role but as is now known since wednesday  the big player amazon has obtained their  international rights in return the  provider has invested quite a bit of  money because it is set the right cost a  whopping 200 million us dollars in the  end so it seems that amazon has high  hopes for the blockbuster which was  originally supposed to be released at  the end of 2020.  just like coming to america or without  remorse to name but a few the tomorrow  war belongs to a series of movies that  were actually intended for theaters but  could not be released in the planned  time frame  the content of the film which is  produced by the director of lego batman  is about the main character played by  chris pratt who is in an intergalactic  war against aliens together with many  other humans in the course of this  clever scientists come up with the idea  of sending soldiers from the past  back to the battlefield of the present  the international release date for the  tomorrow war is july 2nd  2021 on amazon prime  some days ago actress terrorists spoke  about a possible sequel to the american  pie series in an interview  allegedly a script already exists that  she herself considers to be great  she also confirmed that american pie  will definitely come  she just doesn't know when the american  pie franchise has existed since 1999 and  includes a total of four films to date  the last of which titled american pie  presents girls rules  was released last year let's just hope  that the new movie won't be as bad as  girls rules  a release date is not known yet sadly  but we will of course keep you up to  date on our website and in our weekly  [Music]  news  [Music]  you

